   "section": "mod-tome/data/talents/misc/races.lua",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "When you crit you have a %d%% chance to reduce by 1 the remaining cooldown of one of your inscriptions and of any saturations effects.\n\t\tThis effect can only happen once per turn.",
   "target": "每次暴击时有 %d%% 几率减少随机一个刻印 1 回合冷却时间，并减少符文饱和与纹身饱和 1 回合持续时间。\n\t\t该效果每回合最多触发一次。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/talents/misc/races.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    1155
   ],
   "previously_reviewed": {
    "A": true,
    "B": true
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "62b21271c82a",
   "unit_id": "62b21271c82a8e09c3324020e3acdfc3c1858f9d06ddd5bf0de3b321badf9dc8",
   "revision_key": "ed572d87b6a7df614914606ff699e52b2895f2e430b82a22b3277d1f9e7eb1d3",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 26941,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/talents/misc/races.lua",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Instantly removes runic and infusion saturations.\n\t\tFor %d turns your inscriptions cool down twice as fast.\n\t\tAt level 5 your command over inscriptions is so good that you can use one more (you still need a category point to unlock it; you need to exit the levelup screen to validate it).",
   "target": "立刻解除符文饱和与纹身饱和。\n\t\t接下来 %d 回合内，你的刻印冷却速度翻倍。\n\t\t技能达到 5 级时，你对刻印的掌控使你可以再使用一个刻印；仍需消耗一个技能树解锁点解锁，而且必须退出升级界面后才会生效。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/talents/misc/races.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    1184
   ],
   "previously_reviewed": {
    "A": true,
    "B": true
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "5ee4a32912b3",
   "unit_id": "5ee4a32912b3b451bc96a6a4917975d833f9085f80df1d970c45b48310a7d82e",
   "revision_key": "b192c2515cfa634392f95f78d3f172ffd461b860db87a24168368b3f477038ec",
   "translation_file": "tome-orcs.lua",
   "translation_line": 6028,
   "section": "tome-orcs/data/talents/uber/mag.lua",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Technomancers are Archmages that dabble in steam technology to enhance their already formidable arsenal of spells.\n\t\tOnce this class evolution is taken, you gain the following:\n\t\t- Arcane Dynamo tinker schematic\n\t\t- Steamtech/Physics category (unlocked)\n\t\t- Steamtech/Chemistry category (locked)\n\t\t- An Automated Portable Extractor (A.P.E.)\n\t\t- One point in the Physics talent Smith and two in Mechanical and Electricity\n\t\t- Spell/Galvanic Technomancy category (locked) - deals with fire and lightning\n\t\t- Spell/Terrene Technomancy category (locked) - deals with earth and water\n\t\t- Spell/Occult Technomancy category (locked) - deals with time and arcane\n\t\t- The ability to unlock one of the three Technomancy categories for free\n\n\t\tOnce put in a robe, the Arcane Dynamo will regenerate Steam each time mana is spent and increase Spellpower based on current steam level.\n\n\t\t#{bold}#As soon as this evolution is used you will need to craft the Arcane Dynamo to place in a robe to benefit from all the powers of the Technomancer.#{normal}#",
   "target": "科技法师是涉猎蒸汽科技的元素法师，他们用科技来强化自己本已强大的法术武库。\n\t\t当你选择这一项进阶职业的时候，你获得以下能力：\n\t\t- 奥术发电机配件配方\n\t\t- 蒸汽科技/物理系 （已解锁）\n\t\t- 蒸汽科技/化学系 （未解锁）\n\t\t- 一个便携式自动材料提取仪（A.P.E.）\n\t\t- 物理系技能铁匠 1 个技能点，机械与电力各 2 个技能点。\n\t\t- 法术/科技法术：放电系 （未解锁）- 使用火焰和闪电\n\t\t- 法术/科技法术：寒岩系 （未解锁）- 使用土和水\n\t\t- 法术/科技法术：玄机系 （未解锁）- 使用时间和奥术\n\t\t- 你可以免费解锁三个科技法术系的其中之一。\n\n\t\t奥术发电机装入长袍后，每当你消耗法力值时都会产生蒸汽，并根据当前蒸汽值提升法术强度。\n\n\t\t#{bold}#一旦使用此进阶，你就需要制作奥术发电机并装入长袍，才能获得科技法师的全部能力。#{normal}#",
   "source_file": "/workspace/tome4-dlcs/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/uber/mag.lua (unpinned public DLC checkout)",
   "source_lines": [
    194
   ],
